<overview>
<p>New technology and creative tactical thinking have long featured in FWLM infantry deployment, with varied unit types and specialized formations treated as the norm rather than the exception. Deploying crew-served Sniper artillery pieces, these platoons provide medium-weight indirect fire support capable of reaching targets at considerable distance. The Sniper's greater range and hitting power compared to the Thumper make it the preferred artillery piece for sustained bombardment missions.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on prototype release of FWL advanced infantry kit
</notes>

